    "reviews": [
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJYULkLFsBBDQR476yl7fzjLU/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paemJFTnBRMVJvVkZNMVVGQkNNbTEwWTJkamRGRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "本身想同屋企人補返父親節飯，點知呢間嘢難食到飛起\n作為一間泰國餐廳，最傳統嘅雞肉Pad Thai都可以整到極難食，明顯就係將金邊粉同雞肉白烚撈埋啲調味就完\n而且一入到去成浸罨味成浸廁所水味，成餐叫做正常嘅剩係得個冬陰功，唔理解點解仲可以咁貴？\n\nTried to have a belated Father's Day dinner with family, but this place was a massive letdown.\nTheir chicken Pad Thai, the most basic Thai dish was terrible, basically just boiled noodles and chicken mixed with sauce. Plus the restaurant smelled like a damp toilet inside. The only edible thing was the Tom Yum soup. Completely overpriced for such garbage quality",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "本身想同屋企人補返父親節飯，點知呢間嘢難食到飛起\n作為一間泰國餐廳，最傳統嘅雞肉Pad Thai都可以整到極難食，明顯就係將金邊粉同雞肉白烚撈埋啲調味就完\n而且一入到去成浸罨味成浸廁所水味，成餐叫做正常嘅剩係得個冬陰功，唔理解點解仲可以咁貴？\n\nTried to have a belated Father's Day dinner with family, but this place was a massive letdown.\nTheir chicken Pad Thai, the most basic Thai dish was terrible, basically just boiled noodles and chicken mixed with sauce. Plus the restaurant smelled like a damp toilet inside. The only edible thing was the Tom Yum soup. Completely overpriced for such garbage quality",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Leon Chan",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105177497857269643597/reviews",
